<title>JAPAN: Nippon Shokubai -Dec-Mar group forecast.</title>
<headline>Nippon Shokubai -Dec-Mar group forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Group)		FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		 52.00	     158.46</p>
<p> Current		3.20		10.08</p>
